---
description: Detection Naming and Structure Standards
globs: ["**/*.pp"]
alwaysApply: true
---

When working with detection files:

1. File Naming:
- Use lowercase with underscores (e.g., cloudtrail.pp, route_53.pp)
- Place all detection files in detections/ directory
- Place documentation in detections/docs/ directory

2. Detection Block Structure:
- Name format must be: detection "{service}_{specific_event}"
- Names should be descriptive and action-oriented
- Always include service prefix in name
- Use lowercase with underscores throughout

Required fields and order:
```hcl
detection "service_event_name" {
  title           = "Title in Title Case"
  description     = "Single sentence starting with 'Detect when...'"
  documentation   = file("./detections/docs/detection_name.md")
  severity        = "low|medium|high|critical"
  display_columns = local.detection_display_columns
  query           = query.matching_query_name
  tags = merge(local.service_common_tags, {
    mitre_attack_ids = "TAXXXX:TXXXX.XXX"
  })
}
``` 
